        "TileImage": "$($repository df4c81df-c140-4483-89e2-f48e9b1e87e9).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\rIt seems the resort has taken the concept of reinvention rather literally.\r\rFive villa guards. One face. Not a single hair between them. \rWhether this is an unfortunate coincidence, an experimental cloning programme, or simply the island&#39;s peculiar approach to identity protection remains unclear.\r\rOur client, however, has no interest in solving the mystery.\r\rFive identical men, 47. One exceptionally thorough redundancy programme.\r\rDo try to enjoy the scenery.\r\rGood hunting.",
